---
/**
 * @license MIT
 * ============================================================================
 * src/pages/artists/index.astro — Artist Roster Directory (`/artists`)
 * ============================================================================
 * PLAIN-ENGLISH OVERVIEW (100-LEVEL JAVASCRIPT & ASTRO 6 GUIDE):
 * What is this file?
 *   In Astro 6 file-based routing, placing `index.astro` inside a subfolder
 *   (`src/pages/artists/index.astro`) maps to that folder's root URL: `/artists`.
 *   Notice the relative import path `../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro` uses `..`
 *   twice because we are two folders deep (`src/pages/artists/`).
 *
 * How does it fit into the build lifecycle?
 *   - Data Inputs: `src/data/artistLore.mjs` (band biographies & links),
 *     `raggiesoft-assets/engine-room-records/catalog.json` (live album & song
 *     counts), and `src/data/ported-pages.json` (73 archival sub-dossiers).
 *   - Static Compilation: `scripts/build.mjs` calls `renderArtistsIndexPage(catalog)`
 *     and appends the Master Archive Directory before writing `./dist/artists/index.html`.
 *
 * What visible UI does `/artists` produce?
 *   A 2-column directory grid introducing every musical project distributed under
 *   Engine Room Records, complete with band emblems, `ERR-00X` catalog badges,
 *   release/track totals, dossier links, and direct streaming buttons to
 *   `https://music.raggiesoft.com`.
 * ============================================================================
 */

// Step up two directory levels (`../../`) to import BaseLayout from `src/layouts/`.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<!-- Render the outer document frame for `/artists` -->
<BaseLayout
  title="Artist Roster & Band Lore Directory | Engine Room Records"
  description="Explore all 7 bands on Engine Room Records: The Stardust Engine, Fractured Prisms, The Paper Wall, Arctic Symphony, Crimson Node, Mana Canvas, and Firelight."
  canonicalPath="/artists"
>
  <!-- Roster cards and 73-route dossier directory compiled via renderArtistsIndexPage() in scripts/build.mjs -->
</BaseLayout>
